OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over Russian plot
OL,4,Aagainst drone firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was prepared to "sabotage" a UK
OL,7,Fdrone factory on behalf of Russia's
OL,8,Fintelligence services, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FJoshua Cammidge, from Swindon in
OL,12,FWiltshire, allegedly researched four
OL,13,Fdrone manufacturing sites in the town
OL,14,Fand carried out reconnaissance.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
