OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1789043179
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over Russian plot
OL,4,Aagainst drone firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 31-year-old is charged with
OL,7,Fassisting a foreign intelligence
OL,8,Fservice and intending to commit or
OL,9,Fengage in conduct to prepare an act of
OL,10,Fsabotage. It is alleged he communicated
OL,11,Fwith an individual believed to be
OL,12,Flinked to the GRU Volunteer Corps, a
OL,13,Fgroup controlled by Russia's
OL,14,Fintelligence services.
OL,16,FCammidge, of Galsworthy Close, appeared
OL,17,Fat Westminster Magistrates' Court and
OL,18,Fwas remanded in custody. He made no
OL,19,Fplea.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
